            "block_content": "The Employer shall notify the Union not later than 4:00 P.M. on the preceding Friday. In the event his employees are to perform any work on Saturday. In so notifying the Union, he shall furnish the Union with his name and location where the job is to be performed. In the event there is a failure to notify the Union of intended Saturday work, the Union shall have the right to call for an immediate audit of the Employer's records at the Employer's expense.",
